<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονίσᾰλος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, in later Mss. sts. wrongly
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονίσσαλος, ὁ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόνις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cloud of dust</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς ἄρα τῶν ὑπὸ ποσσὶ κ. ὄρνυτ᾽
					ἀελλής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκοὶ ὕπερθε γένοντο κονισάλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.503
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.401
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> the mixed
				<i>dust, oil and sweat</i> on wrestlers, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.283
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a demon of
			the same class as Priapus, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				982
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				174.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1027.10
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lascivious dance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
